    <summary>Desktop GUI for browsing, querying and visualizing MongoDB and SQL databases.</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[VisuaLeaf is a desktop tool for browsing, querying and visualizing MongoDB and SQL databases.

## Pricing

VisuaLeaf is freemium. The free Community Edition is limited to 3 saved MongoDB connections and does not include the visual query builder. The paid Basic and Professional tiers remove these limits, and a 14-day Pro trial is available. See https://visualeaf.com/pricing for details.

## Features

See https://visualeaf.com/features for the full tour.

### Explore and manage

- **Connection Manager:** keep MongoDB, PostgreSQL, MySQL, SQL Server, SQLite and other connections in one place and switch between them quickly.
- **Browse Collections:** browse MongoDB collections and SQL tables, with tree, table and BSON views.
- **MongoDB Shell and SQL Scripts:** run mongosh commands or SQL scripts with syntax highlighting, autocomplete and command history.
- **SQL Mode for MongoDB:** query MongoDB collections with SQL and see the find() or aggregation pipeline it becomes.
- **Index Manager:** create, view and manage indexes visually on MongoDB and SQL databases.
- **GridFS Viewer:** manage and preview files stored in MongoDB GridFS.
- **Split Panel Views:** open collections, tables, queries, ER diagrams and dashboards side by side.
- **SQL Editor:** write and run SQL with autocomplete, work in a transaction with Commit and Rollback, and stop long queries.
- **Table Management:** create and change SQL tables, keys, indexes, triggers and CHECK constraints with a live SQL preview.
- **Redis Browser:** browse and edit Redis keys of every type, run CLI scripts and watch server health.

### Build and optimize

- **Visual Query Builder:** build SQL with suggested JOINs and a live preview, or MongoDB filters with AND/OR groups.
- **Aggregation Pipeline:** build aggregation pipelines with stage-by-stage previews and performance metrics.
- **ER Diagrams and Visual Schema:** generate ER diagrams from SQL foreign keys or MongoDB collections.
- **Schema Validation:** design JSON Schemas visually with full BSON types and one-click verification.
- **Query Profiler:** find slow queries in MongoDB and SQL databases and get index suggestions.
- **Mock Data Generator:** fill a database with realistic, linked test data in seconds.
- **AI Assistant and MCP:** get AI help with queries, aggregations and explain plans, or connect your own assistant through the MCP server.

### Automate and visualize

- **Charts and Dashboards:** chart SQL query or aggregation results with 20+ chart types and pin them to dashboards.
- **Data Transfer:** run and monitor imports, exports and migrations between databases and files.
- **Data Sync:** sync, copy and migrate data between MongoDB and SQL databases and environments.
- **Data Compare:** compare MongoDB collections or SQL tables and spot differences instantly.
- **RBAC Dashboard:** manage users, roles and permissions.

### Operate and scale

- **MongoDB Clusters:** deploy replica sets and sharded clusters to Docker or your own servers, then upgrade, resize and back them up.
- **Sharding:** see which shard holds each collection's data and shard a collection with a guided Shard Key Advisor.

## Notes

- This package installs the 64-bit (x64) version of VisuaLeaf for all users on the machine.
- VisuaLeaf updates itself automatically when a new version is released. The version shown by Chocolatey can therefore lag behind the version actually installed. The Chocolatey package is updated for each release as well.
]]></description>
